{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/256390-sources-of-inspiration-for-geist","id":256390,"title":"Sources of inspiration for Geist.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-13T18:05:16-07:00","id":256390,"title":"Sources of inspiration for Geist.","content":"<span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm looking for sources of inspiration for Geist. So far I have the anime &quot;Mirage of Blaze&quot; on Hulu; the greywalker series by Kat Richardson (so far I've gotten through the 4th Novel Vanished and read the short story &quot;The third death of the little clay dog&quot; in the anthology &quot;Mean Streets&quot;) and chapter 8: Ancestral Spirits and Graveyard Magic in &quot;The Candle and the Crossroads: a book of appalachian conjure and southern root work by Orion Foxwood. Does anyone else have a source of inspiration they would like to recomend?</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1869-moonwolf8","name":"moonwolf8","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T18:40:38-07:00","id":256412,"title":"","content":"I would suggest the Blackwell Legacy games. The main character Rose has an almost geist like situation with her partner Joey.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-14T02:48:07-07:00","id":256585,"title":"","content":"<i>The Crow</i> is a given. Far from precise but can work for a Torn.<br /> <br /> The ghost stories of M. R. James I always recommend for anything involving ghosts.<br /> <br /> <i>The Innocents</i> with Deborah Kerr based on<i> The Turn of the Screw</i> by Henry James is a good ghost story movie, and <i>The Turn of the Screw</i> makes pretty good reading.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/2