[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 10-02-2014, 07:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T12:15:48-07:00","id":271674,"title":"","content":"A couple more... Casper (seriously, the film's a kid film and not the best but it follows the unfinished business rule for anchors and stuff), one big vote for Ju-On and The Ring and films of their ilk (Japanese originals, not the remakes) and FeardotCom is a pretty interesting take on a ghost. Reminds me of the website tale from Cradle of Fear though...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T10:04:46-07:00","id":273993,"title":"","content":"The anime &quot;JoJo's Bizarre Adventure&quot; is a fighting series that aired in the '90s. It revolved around people who have Geist-like spirits bonded to them. Think ultraviolent &quot;Street Fighter&quot; meets &quot;Sin Eaters.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/36-tomewilson","name":"tomewilson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar36_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T14:26:13-07:00","id":274173,"title":"","content":"JJBA and Persona 3 &amp; 4 are, IMO, some of the best inspiration for Geist you can find. Weird, creepy, and overall awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T15:38:31-07:00","id":274211,"title":"","content":"All of the Persona games are good for Geist, really, but 3 is probably the most Geist-like, what with the importance of Death and the ritual suicide reenactments. The other games <a href=\"http://img4.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20110817020353/megamitensei/images/2/22/Kandori%27s_Persona.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">ain't</a> <a href=\"http://img2.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20110601115558/megamitensei/images/f/f6/P4-persona-take-mikazuchi.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">no</a> <a href=\"http://img1.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20131125113304/megamitensei/images/c/c1/Hades_P2.png\" target=\"_blank\">slouches</a>, though.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tomewilson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/256390-sources-of-inspiration-for-geist?p=273993#post273993\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The anime &quot;JoJo's Bizarre Adventure&quot; is a fighting series that aired in the '90s. It revolved around people who have Geist-like spirits bonded to them. Think ultraviolent &quot;Street Fighter&quot; meets &quot;Sin Eaters.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>You'll be pleased to know that there's an ongoing revival series, meant to cover <i>every</i> JoJo. They're halfway through Stardust Crusaders at the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T15:46:29-07:00","id":274219,"title":"","content":"In a certain light, some interpretations of characters like Ghost Rider or the Spectre could be inspiration for vigilante-style Sin-Eaters.<br /> <br /> Todd McFarlane's Haunt comic series is another one about a former priest who's literally haunted by the ghost of his paramilitary secret agent brother, and manifests supernatural powers when they possess each other. (The story and characters were kind of hit-or-miss for me when I read it, but that's true for a lot of McFarlane's stuff and the overall concept still works as inspiration.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T21:16:33-07:00","id":274467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/256390-sources-of-inspiration-for-geist?p=274211#post274211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All of the Persona games are good for Geist, really, but 3 is probably the most Geist-like, what with the importance of Death and the ritual suicide reenactments. The other games <a href=\"http://img4.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20110817020353/megamitensei/images/2/22/Kandori%27s_Persona.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">ain't</a> <a href=\"http://img2.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20110601115558/megamitensei/images/f/f6/P4-persona-take-mikazuchi.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">no</a> <a href=\"http://img1.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20131125113304/megamitensei/images/c/c1/Hades_P2.png\" target=\"_blank\">slouches</a>, though.<br /> <br /> <br /> You'll be pleased to know that there's an ongoing revival series, meant to cover <i>every</i> JoJo. They're halfway through Stardust Crusaders at the moment.</div> </div> </div> </div>And it is amazing!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxrkv14ojD_TQXU0RBvF33Q\" target=\"_blank\">Fool's Corner Productions</a>: Where we review Video Game, and eventually tabletop RPGs<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/461-kingcarnival","name":"KingCarnival","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar461_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T01:54:13-07:00","id":274574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KingCarnival</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.th